WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.852
This decision tree provides a simple reasoning
process First ask

00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:11.638
whether the values are labels or quantities If they
are labels ask

00:00:11.664 --> 00:00:17.220
whether a meaningful order exists If they are
quantities ask whether the scale has a

00:00:17.246 --> 00:00:22.934
true zero This framework works well for many common
variables but

00:00:22.961 --> 00:00:28.646
domain context still matters When unsure explain
which comparisons

00:00:28.659 --> 00:00:31.409
or arithmetic statements would make real-world sense
